Package: com.phoni.phonilock
Name: PhoniLock
Version: 0.1.0~beta1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Customize your iOS 12 lock-screen clock, date, colors, and text.
 Settings are in Settings > PhoniLock. Includes font and size choices, alignment,
 custom text, and switches to hide clock/date, unlock hints, page dots, and the lock icon.
 First beta: compiled and package-checked, but not tested on a physical iPhone.
Maintainer: Phoni
Author: Phoni
Section: Tweaks
Tag: role::enduser
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 12.0), firmware (<< 13.0)
